  "ruleText": "Pas 307.02 Attendants. No person less than 16 years of age shall work as an attendant on any passenger tramway.\n\nSource. #2297, eff 2-7-83; ss by #2704, eff 5-9-84, EXPIRED 5-9-90 (formerly Saf-S 1006.02)\n\nNew. #4862, eff 7-10-90; ss by #6284, eff 7-10-96; ss by #7800, eff 12-11-02, EXPIRED: 12-11-10\n\nNew. #10072, eff 1-11-12; ss by #13429-B, eff 8-6-22 (formerly Saf-C 306.02) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Pas 300)",
